#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:2
msgid "Mobile deployment troubleshooting"
msgstr "모바일 배포 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:8
msgid ""
"I keep getting a message \"Cannot connect to the server. Please check "
"your server URL and internet connection.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서버에 연결할 수 없습니다. 서버 URL과 인터넷 연결을 확인하세요.\"라는 메시지가 "
"계속 표시됩니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:10
msgid ""
"First, confirm that your server URL has no typos and that it includes "
"``http://`` or ``https://`` according to the server deployment "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"먼저 서버 URL에 오타가 없는지, 그리고 서버 배포 구성에 따라 ``http://`` 또는 "
"``https://``\\ 가 포함되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:12
msgid ""
"If the server URL is correct, there could be an issue with the SSL "
"certificate configuration."
msgstr ""
"서버 URL이 올바르다면 SSL 인증서 구성에 문제가 있을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:14
msgid ""
"To check your SSL certificate set up, test it by visiting a site such as "
"`SSL Labs <https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/index.html>`__. If there’s an "
"error about the missing chain or certificate path, there is likely an "
"intermediate certificate missing that needs to be included."
msgstr ""
"SSL 인증서 설정을 확인하려면 `SSL Labs "
"<https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/index.html>`__\\ 와 같은 사이트를 방문하여 "
"테스트하세요. 누락된 체인이나 인증서 경로에 대한 오류가 있다면, 포함되어야 할 "
"중간 인증서가 누락되었을 가능성이 높습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:16
msgid ""
"Please note that the apps cannot connect to servers with self-signed "
"certificates, consider using :ref:`Let's Encrypt <deployment-guide/server"
"/setup-nginx-proxy:configure nginx with ssl and http/2>` instead."
msgstr ""
"앱은 자체 서명 인증서를 사용하는 서버에 연결할 수 없으므로, 대신 :ref:`Let's "
"Encrypt <deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy:configure nginx with ssl "
"and http/2>` 사용을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:19
msgid "Login with ADFS/Office365 is not working"
msgstr "ADFS/Office365 로그인이 작동하지 않음"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:21
msgid ""
"In line with Microsoft guidance we recommend `configuring intranet forms-"
"based authentication for devices that do not support WIA "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/identity/ad-"
"fs/operations/configure-intranet-forms-based-authentication-for-devices-"
"that-do-not-support-wia>`_."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 지침에 따라 `WIA를 지원하지 않는 기기에 대해 인트라넷 양식 기반 인증을 "
"구성 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/identity/ad-"
"fs/operations/configure-intranet-forms-based-authentication-for-devices-"
"that-do-not-support-wia>`_\\ 할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:24
msgid "I see a “Connecting…” bar that does not go away"
msgstr "사라지지 않는 \"Connecting…\" 막대가 표시됩니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:26
msgid ""
"If your app is working properly, you should see a grey “Connecting…” bar "
"that clears or says “Connected” after the app reconnects."
msgstr ""
"앱이 정상적으로 작동한다면, 회색 \"Connecting…\" 막대가 표시되었다가 앱이 다시 "
"연결된 후 사라지거나 \"Connected\"로 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:28
msgid ""
"If you are seeing this message all the time, and your internet connection"
" seems fine, ask your server administrator if the server uses NGINX or "
"another webserver as a reverse proxy. If so, they should check that it is"
" configured correctly for :ref:`supporting the websocket connection for "
"APIv4 endpoints <deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-proxy:configure "
"nginx as a proxy for mattermost server>`."
msgstr ""
"이 메시지가 항상 표시되고 인터넷 연결에는 문제가 없어 보인다면, 서버 관리자에게 "
"서버가 NGINX나 다른 웹 서버를 리버스 프록시로 사용하는지 문의하세요. 그렇다면 "
"관리자는 :ref:`APIv4 엔드포인트에 대한 웹소켓 연결 지원 <deployment-guide/server"
"/setup-nginx-proxy:configure nginx as a proxy for mattermost server>`\\ 을 "
"위해 올바르게 구성되었는지 확인해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:31
msgid ""
"All my outbound connections need to go through a proxy. How can I connect"
" to the Mattermost Hosted Push Notification Service?"
msgstr ""
"모든 아웃바운드 연결이 프록시를 거쳐야 합니다. Mattermost Hosted Push "
"Notification Service에 어떻게 연결할 수 있나요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:33
msgid ""
"You can set up an internal server to proxy the connection out of their "
"network to the Mattermost Hosted Push Notification Service (HPNS) by "
"following the steps below:"
msgstr ""
"아래 단계에 따라 내부 서버를 설정하여 네트워크 밖으로 나가는 연결을 Mattermost "
"Hosted Push Notification Service(HPNS)로 프록시할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:35
msgid ""
"Make sure your proxy server is properly configured to support SSL. "
"Confirm it works by checking the URL at https://www.digicert.com/help/."
msgstr ""
"프록시 서버가 SSL을 지원하도록 올바르게 구성되어 있는지 확인하세요. "
"https://www.digicert.com/help/\\ 에서 URL을 확인하여 작동하는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:36
msgid "Setup a proxy to forward requests to ``https://push.mattermost.com``."
msgstr "``https://push.mattermost.com``\\ 으로 요청을 전달하도록 프록시를 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:37
msgid ""
"In Mattermost set **System Console** > **Notification Settings** > "
"**Mobile Push** > **Enable Push Notifications** in prior versions or "
"**System Console > Environment > Push Notification Server > Enable Push "
"Notifications** in versions after 5.12 to \"Manually enter Push "
"Notification Service location\""
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST에서 이전 버전의 경우 **관리자 도구** > **Notification Settings** > "
"**Mobile Push** > **Enable Push Notifications**\\ 를, 5.12 이후 버전의 경우 "
"**관리자 도구 > Environment > Push Notification Server > Enable Push "
"Notifications**\\ 를 \"Manually enter Push Notification Service location\"으로 "
"설정합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:38
msgid "Enter the URL of your proxy in the **Push Notification Server** field."
msgstr "**Push Notification Server** 필드에 프록시의 URL을 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:42
msgid ""
"Depending on how your proxy is configured you may need to add a port "
"number and create a URL like ``https://push.internalproxy.com:8000`` "
"mapped to ``https://push.mattermost.com``"
msgstr ""
"프록시 구성 방식에 따라 포트 번호를 추가하고 ``https://push.mattermost.com``\\ "
"에 매핑되는 ``https://push.internalproxy.com:8000``\\ 과 같은 URL을 만들어야 "
"할 수도 있습니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:45
msgid "Build gets stuck at ``bundleReleaseJsAndAssets``"
msgstr "빌드가 ``bundleReleaseJsAndAssets``\\ 에서 멈춤"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:47
msgid "As a workaround, you can bundle the ``js`` manually first with"
msgstr "해결 방법으로, 먼저 다음으로 ``js``\\ 를 수동으로 번들링할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:53
msgid "and then ignore the gradle task with"
msgstr "그런 다음 다음으로 gradle 작업을 무시합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:60
msgid "No image previews available in the mobile app"
msgstr "모바일 앱에서 이미지 미리보기를 사용할 수 없음"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:62
msgid ""
"This can happen if the server running Mattermost has its mime types not "
"set up correctly. A server running Linux has this file located in "
"``/etc/mime.types``. This might vary depending on your specific OS and "
"distribution."
msgstr ""
"이는 OKR.BEST를 실행하는 서버에 MIME 유형이 올바르게 설정되지 않은 경우 발생할 "
"수 있습니다. Linux를 실행하는 서버에서는 이 파일이 ``/etc/mime.types``\\ 에 "
"있습니다. 이는 특정 OS와 배포판에 따라 다를 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:65
msgid ""
"Some distributions also ship without ``mailcap`` which can result in "
"missing or incorrectly configured mime types."
msgstr ""
"일부 배포판은 ``mailcap`` 없이 제공되기도 하는데, 이로 인해 MIME 유형이 "
"누락되거나 잘못 구성될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:68
msgid "Messages with emojis aren't being sent from the Mobile App"
msgstr "모바일 앱에서 이모지가 포함된 메시지가 전송되지 않음"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:70
msgid ""
"This can occur if the server running Mattermost is configured with an "
"incorrect character set. To resolve this issue, in the ``config.json`` "
"file under ``SqlSettings``, ensure that the ``DataSource`` key is "
"configured correctly, then restart the Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
"이는 OKR.BEST를 실행하는 서버가 잘못된 문자 집합으로 구성된 경우 발생할 수 "
"있습니다. 이 문제를 해결하려면 ``config.json`` 파일의 ``SqlSettings``\\ 에서 "
"``DataSource`` 키가 올바르게 구성되어 있는지 확인한 다음, OKR.BEST 서버를 다시 "
"시작하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:72
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "예:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:81
msgid ""
"See our :ref:`Configuration Settings <administration-guide/configure"
"/environment-configuration-settings:data source>` documentation for "
"details on configuring the connection string to the master database."
msgstr ""
"마스터 데이터베이스에 대한 연결 문자열 구성에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`구성 설정 "
"<administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:data "
"source>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:84
msgid "Testing mobile push notifications"
msgstr "모바일 푸시 알림 테스트"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:86
msgid ""
"Make sure to configure push notifications for your :doc:`pre-built mobile"
" apps </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>`, or for "
":doc:`your custom built mobile apps </deployment-guide/mobile/distribute-"
"custom-mobile-apps>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`사전 빌드된 모바일 앱 </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>` "
"또는 :doc:`사용자 지정 빌드 모바일 앱 </deployment-guide/mobile/distribute-"
"custom-mobile-apps>`\\ 에 대해 푸시 알림을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:88
msgid ""
"Then use the following instructions to confirm push notifications are "
"working properly."
msgstr ""
"그런 다음 다음 안내에 따라 푸시 알림이 올바르게 작동하는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:90
msgid ""
"Log in to your mobile app with an account on your Mattermost Server, "
"which we’ll refer to as “Account A”."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 서버의 계정으로 모바일 앱에 로그인하세요. 이 계정을 \"Account A\"라고 "
"부르겠습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:92
msgid ""
"(iOS) When the app asks whether you wish to receive notifications, "
"**confirm you want to receive notifications**."
msgstr ""
"(iOS) 앱이 알림을 받을지 묻는 경우 **알림을 받겠다고 확인**\\ 하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:94
msgid ""
"Mattermost prompts you to confirm whether you want to allow mobile push "
"notifications. To test mobile push notifications, you must select Allow."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 모바일 푸시 알림을 허용할지 확인하도록 요청합니다. 모바일 푸시 알림을 "
"테스트하려면 Allow를 선택해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:98
msgid "Confirm push notifications are enabled for “Account A”."
msgstr "\"Account A\"에 푸시 알림이 활성화되어 있는지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:100
msgid "Go to the notification settings menu in the mobile app."
msgstr "모바일 앱에서 알림 설정 메뉴로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:102
msgid ""
"Access notification settings by selecting your profile picture to access "
"Settings > Notifications."
msgstr ""
"프로필 사진을 선택해 Settings > Notifications로 이동하여 알림 설정에 "
"접근합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:106
msgid "Check that the mobile push notifications are set to send."
msgstr "모바일 푸시 알림이 전송되도록 설정되어 있는지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:108
msgid ""
"Select Push Notifications to confirm when mobile push notifications will "
"be sent."
msgstr ""
"Push Notifications를 선택하여 모바일 푸시 알림이 언제 전송될지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:112
msgid ""
"Specify whether all new messages or only mentions and direct messages "
"send push notifications."
msgstr ""
"모든 새 메시지에 대해 푸시 알림을 보낼지, 아니면 멘션과 개인 메시지에 대해서만 "
"보낼지 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:116
msgid "Have “Account A” put the app to background or close the app."
msgstr "\"Account A\"에서 앱을 백그라운드로 전환하거나 앱을 닫습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:118
msgid "Using a browser, log in to “Account B” on the same Mattermost Server."
msgstr "브라우저를 사용하여 동일한 OKR.BEST 서버에서 \"Account B\"로 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:120
msgid "Open a direct message with “Account A”, and send a message."
msgstr "\"Account A\"와의 개인 메시지를 열고 메시지를 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:122
msgid ""
"A push notification with the message should appear on the mobile device "
"of “Account A”."
msgstr ""
"\"Account A\"의 모바일 기기에 해당 메시지가 담긴 푸시 알림이 표시되어야 "
"합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:125
msgid "Troubleshooting push notifications"
msgstr "푸시 알림 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:127
msgid ""
"If you did not receive a push notification when testing push "
"notifications, use the following procedure to troubleshoot:"
msgstr ""
"푸시 알림을 테스트할 때 푸시 알림을 받지 못했다면 다음 절차에 따라 문제를 "
"해결하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:129
msgid ""
"In **System Console > Environment > Logging > File Log Level**, select "
"**DEBUG** in order to watch for push notifications in the server log."
msgstr ""
"서버 로그에서 푸시 알림을 확인하려면 **관리자 도구 > Environment > Logging > "
"File Log Level**\\ 에서 **DEBUG**\\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:131
msgid "Delete your mobile application, and reinstall it."
msgstr "모바일 애플리케이션을 삭제한 후 다시 설치합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:133
msgid ""
"Log in with \"Account A\" and **confirm you want to receive push "
"notifications** when prompted by the mobile app."
msgstr ""
"\"Account A\"로 로그인하고 모바일 앱이 요청할 때 **푸시 알림을 받겠다고 "
"확인**\\ 하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:135
msgid ""
"Go to **Profile** > **Security** > **View and Logout of Active Sessions**"
" to confirm that there is a session for the native mobile app matching "
"your login time."
msgstr ""
"**Profile** > **Security** > **View and Logout of Active Sessions**\\ 로 "
"이동하여 로그인 시간과 일치하는 네이티브 모바일 앱 세션이 있는지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:137
msgid "Retest push notifications."
msgstr "푸시 알림을 다시 테스트합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:139
msgid ""
"If no push notification displays, go to **System Console** > **Server "
"Logs**, then select **Reload**. Look at the bottom of the logs for a "
"message similar to:"
msgstr ""
"푸시 알림이 표시되지 않으면 **관리자 도구** > **Server Logs**\\ 로 이동한 다음 "
"**Reload**\\ 를 선택합니다. 로그 하단에서 다음과 유사한 메시지를 찾으세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:141
msgid ""
"``[2016/04/21 03:16:44 UTC] [DEBG] Sending push notification to "
"608xyz0... wi msg of '@accountb: Hello'``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:143
msgid ""
"If the log message displays, it means a message was sent to the HPNS "
"server and was not received by your mobile app. Please `create a support "
"ticket <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_ with the "
"subject \"HPNS issue\" for help from Mattermost's Support team."
msgstr ""
"로그 메시지가 표시되면 HPNS 서버로 메시지가 전송되었으나 모바일 앱이 수신하지 "
"못했음을 의미합니다. Mattermost 지원 팀의 도움을 받으려면 \"HPNS issue\"라는 "
"제목으로 `지원 티켓을 생성 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/requests/new>`_\\ 하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:144
msgid ""
"If the log message does not display, it means no mobile push notification"
" was sent to “Account A”. Please repeat the process starting at step 2 "
"and double-check each step."
msgstr ""
"로그 메시지가 표시되지 않으면 \"Account A\"로 전송된 모바일 푸시 알림이 없음을 "
"의미합니다. 2단계부터 과정을 반복하면서 각 단계를 다시 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:148
msgid ""
"To conserve disk space, once your push notification issue is resolved, go"
" to  **System Console > Environment > Logging > File Log Level**, then "
"select **ERROR** to switch your logging detail level from **DEBUG** to "
"**Errors Only**."
msgstr ""
"디스크 공간을 절약하려면 푸시 알림 문제가 해결된 후 **관리자 도구 > Environment "
"> Logging > File Log Level**\\ 로 이동한 다음 **ERROR**\\ 를 선택하여 로깅 상세 "
"수준을 **DEBUG**\\ 에서 **Errors Only**\\ 로 전환하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-troubleshooting.rst:150
msgid ""
"If push notifications are not being delivered on the mobile device, "
"confirm that you're logged in to the **Native** mobile app session "
"through **Profile > Security > View and Log Out of Active Sessions**. "
"Otherwise, the `DeviceId` won't get registered in the `Sessions` table "
"and notifications won't be delivered."
msgstr ""
"모바일 기기에 푸시 알림이 전달되지 않으면 **Profile > Security > View and Log "
"Out of Active Sessions**\\ 를 통해 **Native** 모바일 앱 세션에 로그인되어 "
"있는지 확인하세요. 그렇지 않으면 `DeviceId`\\ 가 `Sessions` 테이블에 등록되지 "
"않아 알림이 전달되지 않습니다."

